    {
      "id": "claim_1cd0f0a3a7de4634915017ef9b9f4b50",
      "statement": "tabId targeting is stateless and per-call: each tab-operating MCP tool accepts an optional tabId input, and when tabId is omitted every layer falls back to the active foreground tab via tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true }), so existing single-tab callers keep working unchanged. There is no select_tab session-level default.",
