    {
      "id": "claim_91b99cb0180d4df0816881e15e871f51",
      "statement": "tabId flows as a string from MCP tool input through page-actions.ts and websocket-client.ts into the WebSocket envelope's target.tabId field; targetEnvelope only adds target when a targeting field is present. The WS server forwards the envelope unchanged, and the extension's extractTabId parses message.target.tabId to an integer (undefined when absent), which the shared page-reader uses directly as the sendMessage/executeScript target.",
