    {
      "id": "claim_2bcbea96e7e04a71a0a5e4d2a4583746",
      "statement": "Before each read or action on a tab, the shared page-reader fires a show_brijio_tab_indicator message (best-effort, errors swallowed) after injecting content.js, so the user can see which tab Brijio is targeting. The indicator is a tab-title prefix and in-page banner; targeting a different tab sends hide to the previous and show to the new tab.",
      "evidence": [
