      "id": "claim_1cfa3c27a4aa48fcb871773b47fe191d",
      "statement": "Element IDs are short-lived and expire on navigation or DOM mutation. After navigate_to_url or any change that invalidates the page snapshot, the agent must call read_current_page (with the same tabId) to get fresh IDs before interacting with elements; the navigation result only reports URL/title and does not provide usable element IDs.",
