    {
      "id": "claim_813c3f7d6c1742a68d6eef5dcd15ce2c",
      "statement": "The perform_batch and navigate_to_url MCP tool wrappers declare tabId in their input interfaces and the underlying page-actions.ts / websocket-client.ts functions accept and forward tabId, but the tool wrappers do not pass input.tabId through to their page-actions.ts calls. Consequently an agent sending tabId to those two tools gets active-tab behavior despite the schema advertising targeting. Other tab-operating tools (read_current_page, click_element, fill_input, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, upload_file, capture_screenshot, download/fetch) normalize and forward tabId correctly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/batch-tool.ts#L9-L99",
