      "id": "claim_cc20f8da25ef433c91ac410fe75ca8b6",
      "statement": "The MCP page-actions config supports a defaultTabId; each page-actions function applies tabId ?? config.defaultTabId before forwarding to the websocket-client, giving a server-side default target that per-call tabId overrides. openNewTab does not use defaultTabId because open_tab creates a tab rather than targeting one.",
