    {
      "id": "claim_1646ba0b297648a1a7ac52f86f0f9447",
      "statement": "ADR 0060 (Explicit Tab Listing and Selection) introduces list_tabs, the per-call tabId parameter, the target.tabId envelope field, and the tab indicator UX; ADR 0062 (Thread tabId Through the Entire Action Stack) closes the extension-layer gap so tabId reaches chrome.tabs.sendMessage(tabId) instead of being dropped; ADR 0063 (Open Tab Action) adds the open_tab tool. Together they are the source of truth for multi-tab targeting and must be reconciled with any divergence in tool behavior.",
      "evidence": [
        {
